{"schema_version":"1.9.2","id":"CLSA-2026-1793300840","published":"2026-10-29T19:07:34Z","modified":"2026-11-20T10:28:34.410456490Z","upstream":["CVE-2022-0685","CVE-2022-1735","CVE-2022-2264","CVE-2022-2289","CVE-2022-2571"],"summary":"vim: Fix of 5 CVEs","details":"- CVE-2022-1735: re-check the Visual start position after every buffer change with check_visual_pos() so a change made in Visual mode cannot leave it past the end of the line or buffer\n- CVE-2022-2289: stop :diffget/:diffput when mark_adjust() has freed the current diff block, so the loop no longer reads the freed block\n- CVE-2022-2264: subtract the unused trailing block padding from the put length in do_put() so the end mark is not set past the end of the line\n- CVE-2022-2571: check the line length before skipping the completion prefix in ins_compl_get_exp() and find_pattern_in_path() so insert mode completion cannot read past the end of the line\n- CVE-2022-0685: use vim_isalpha() instead of isalpha() in unix_expandpath() so a special multi-byte character cannot crash file name expansion","affected":[{"package":{"name":"vim-X11","ecosystem":"TuxCare:AlmaLinux:9.6","purl":"pkg:rpm/tuxcare/vim-X11?distro=almalinux-9.6"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"2:8.2.2637-22.el9_6.1.tuxcare.els45"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/cloudlinux/tuxcare-osv/tree/main/data/els_os/almalinux9.6esu/CLSA-2026-1793300840.json"}},{"package":{"name":"vim-common","ecosystem":"TuxCare:AlmaLinux:9.6","purl":"pkg:rpm/tuxcare/vim-common?distro=almalinux-9.6"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"2:8.2.2637-22.el9_6.1.tuxcare.els45"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/cloudlinux/tuxcare-osv/tree/main/data/els_os/almalinux9.6esu/CLSA-2026-1793300840.json"}},{"package":{"name":"vim-enhanced","ecosystem":"TuxCare:AlmaLinux:9.6","purl":"pkg:rpm/tuxcare/vim-enhanced?distro=almalinux-9.6"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":